  "about": "The epistola of the formulary “Third Sunday of Lent” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Brethren: Be followers of God, as most dear children; and walk in love, as Christ also loved us and delivered Himself for us, an oblation and a sacrifice to God for an odor of sweetness. But fornication and all uncleanness or covetousness, let it not so much as be named among you, as befits saints; or obscenity, or foolish talking, or scurrility, which is to no purpose; but rather giving of thanks. For know this and understand, that no fornicator or unclean or covetous person, which is the service of idols, has inheritance in the kingdom of Christ and of God. Let no man deceive you with vain words, for because of these things the anger of God comes upon the children of unbelief. Do not, therefore, become partakers with them. For you were once darkness, but now light in the Lord. Walk as children of the light, for the fruit of the light is in all goodness and justice and truth.", "alignments": [{ "words": ["w029", "w030"], "anchor": "w029", "gloss": "But fornication" }, { "words": ["w036", "w037"], "anchor": "w037", "gloss": "let not even be named" }, { "words": ["w052", "w053"], "anchor": "w053", "gloss": "does not pertain" }, { "words": ["w056", "w057"], "anchor": "w057", "gloss": "thanksgiving" }, { "words": ["w058", "w059", "w060"], "anchor": "w060", "gloss": "For know this" }, { "words": ["w071", "w072"], "anchor": "w072", "gloss": "the service of idols" }, { "words": ["w073", "w074"], "anchor": "w074", "gloss": "has no" }, { "words": ["w086", "w087", "w088"], "anchor": "w086", "gloss": "for because of these things" }, { "words": ["w100", "w101"], "anchor": "w100", "gloss": "For you were" }, { "words": ["w104", "w105"], "anchor": "w104", "gloss": "but now" }, { "words": ["w113", "w114"], "anchor": "w113", "gloss": "for the fruit" }] }
  },
